                                                "sense_id": "9eb402d6-0408-3477-851f-ddc6c383c5f4",
                                                "text": "Emily Wong: Commander Shepard? Excuse me, Commander Shepard!\nEmily Wong: I'm Emily Wong. I'm an investigative journalist working here on the Citadel. Could I have a moment of your time?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "55c20d54-7528-4524-a18b-d4b3f6a443d2",
                                                "sense_id": "9eb402d6-0408-3477-851f-ddc6c383c5f4",
                                                "text": "But in 2012, his career as an investigative journalist in the mainstream media was temporarily ended: he, together with his investigative reporting team and the chief editor of the China Economic Times were dismissed."
                                            }
